The /dev/hid virtual DualSense ABI and button constants are adapted from:
  AnyController — BallerIsLeet
  https://github.com/BallerIsLeet/AnyController
  commit 2eec5ec209f7e20369144de37e2358d1b2af0241 (GPL-3.0)
